WEBVTT

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:19.567
Watch the complete reel with sound before saving and exporting.

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:30.286
Save keeps the editable project. The gold Export button creates a separate video file.

00:00:30.286 --> 00:00:43.130
Check the size, quality and format, then use Export. This demo saves to a prepared folder.

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:50.250
The reel is exported. Done closes this, and the editable project stays available for changes.
